## Model card

- **Name:** Qoduck
- **Short description:** Alibaba's Qoder platform (International) anonymous/stealth coding model, launched 2026-11-07 — identity, maker, parameter count, and benchmarks all undisclosed. Individual users get a limited-time daily free allowance (credit rate 0.0x). Speculated in press to be a Qwen 4-family model (tokenizer match); unverified.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder International (Alibaba Cloud coding platform) — individual users only; free daily allowance since 2026-11-07; Teams/Enterprise and IDE/CLI out of scope. Identity officially undisclosed ("Don't ask where it came from").
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-11-07; architecture/vendor unknown; context claimed ~1M tokens (per Qoder promo/press), unverified.
- **IDs:** no public model ID; served only inside Qoder's model picker.
- **Context window:** ~1M tokens claimed (unverified).
- **Modalities:** unknown; positioned as a coding/reasoning model with "maximum thinking intensity" option.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** free during the limited-time launch allowance (0.0x credits); normally 0.5x credits; no public per-token price.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed; press speculation (Qwen 4 Max / MoE variants) is unverified.

